The alliance is a coalition of guests aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]], gathered when the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]]'s tithe rose and the smaller Orgs found they could not each pay it. Its seat is the Heart [[Org/Iconoclasm/Eerie|Eerie]] at berth 14, which the member Orgs share.

[[Org/Alkahest Freight/index|Alkahest Freight]] and [[Org/Solari Sub-surface/index|Solari Sub-surface]] joined outright, and their people moved to berth 14; the [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]] took over the berths and territory they left. [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]] joined but kept its own Heart and berth as a forward base. [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]], the [[Org/The Scale/index|Scale]], the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]] and the Protectorate stand with the alliance without merging, and the Party pays the difference in the tithe for those that ask it.
